{"id":"sicht","lemma":"Sicht","pos":"noun","rank":2031,"glosses":["view","sight","visibility"],"ipa":"/zɪçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/De-Sicht.ogg/De-Sicht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Sicht","plural":"Sichten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kann deine Sicht verstehen.","en":"I can understand your point of view.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to hear and interpret"}]},{"text":"Das Schiff war bald außer Sicht.","en":"The ship was soon out of sight.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"except"},null]},{"text":"Es ist kein Ende in Sicht.","en":"There's no end in sight.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"end, finish"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Möchten Sie meine Sicht der Dinge hören?","en":"Don't you want to hear my side of the story?","words":[{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"thing","l":"Ding"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]},{"text":"Versucht, das Problem aus ihrer Sicht zu sehen.","en":"Try to see the problem from her point of view.","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to see"}]}]}